.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "2026-09-25" "libmyutils 1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words, and characters in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int wordCount(FILE *" file ", int *" lines ", int *" words ", int *" chars ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.BR wordCount ()
function reads the stream pointer and computes line, word, and character counts.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success and 1 on failure.
